  "brief": {
    "en": "The honest floor: an unknown driver (no oshi, no history, no genre data) on an ordinary highway drive with a neutral situation. Scores stay low BY DESIGN — a third of the model's weight (Preference/History) has nothing to act on. This control makes every personalized preset's lift meaningful by comparison.",
